.TH "GYRO" "1" "Nov 2026" "Gyro Hosting" "gyro manual"

.SH NAME
gyro-dns-zone-create - Add a zone


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgyro dns zone create  [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Add a zone

.PP
Claims a domain. It is published on ns1/ns2.gyrodns.net after ownership is verified: delegation to our name servers (immediate when already delegated) or the TXT record \fB_gyrodns-dogrulama.<zone>\fR = \fBtxt_value\fR at your current DNS. Optional \fBbind\fR (zone file) is imported on activation (SOA and apex NS are ignored).

.PP
API: POST /cloud/dns/{id}/zones (operationId typed_post_dns\fBid\fPzones, scope services_write)


